        "collapsible_row_custom_aagMJW": {
          "type": "collapsible_row_custom",
          "settings": {
            "q_1": "Pycnogenol® + Centella",
            "a_1": "<p>An advanced herbal formula built around study-backed Pycnogenol® (French maritime pine bark extract) and Centella asiatica, using 20:1 concentrated extracts for a 6,000mg herb equivalent per softgel. Suspended in MCT coconut oil in a plant-based shell.</p>",
            "q_2": "Simple & Transparent",
            "a_2": "<p>30 softgels per pouch. One softgel a day. No droppers, no teas, nothing to measure. Just a clear formula you can take anywhere.</p>",
            "q_3": "How Does It Support Lymphatic Flow?",
            "a_3": "<p>Your lymphatic system moves fluid through your body all day, relying on healthy circulation and movement. Pycnogenol® and Centella are two of the most researched botanicals for circulation and leg comfort, giving your body gentle, daily support rather than a harsh flush.*</p>",
            "q_4": "How Long Before I Notice a Difference?",
            "a_4": "<p>Everyone is different. Botanical support builds with consistency, so we recommend taking Lymphgem daily for at least 4–8 weeks, alongside hydration and regular movement.*</p>",
            "q_5": "Recommended Use",
            "a_5": "<p>Take one softgel a day with water, ideally with a meal. If you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication (especially blood thinners) or have a medical condition, talk to your healthcare provider before use.</p>",
            "q_6": "Do You Offer a Guarantee?",
            "a_6": "<p>Yes. If Lymphgem isn’t right for you, contact us within 30 days for a full refund.</p>",
            "q_7": "",
            "a_7": "",
